# clj-oa3-test/reports/
#
# What lives here: campaign reports, organized by deployment under
# campaigns/<deployment>/<date>.md. See ../WORKFLOW.md for the convention.
#
# Committed:
#   - *.md  — narrative reports (the deliverable)
#   - *.edn — structured run output (the source of truth, useful for
#             archeology and diffs across runs)
#
# Gitignored:
#   - *.txt — terminal-friendly tabular summary (redundant with .md/.edn,
#             noisy in diffs)
#   - *.log — VTN container logs (often large, mostly noise)

*.txt
*.log
